{{!-- Elementarladungen Bottom-Bar widget (opt-in via the GM tab's own
     elementalChargesEnabled switch, also an Active Effect target) - docked
     BELOW the sheet, same out-of-flow technique as .header-toolbar (see
     header-toolbar.hbs) but anchored to the bottom edge. One round "slot"
     per point of Willenskraft's own modifier, filled round-robin with the
     magic school of each Einfache-Magieschule spell cast - see
     helpers/elementalCharges.mjs.
     ApplicationV2 PARTS must always render exactly one root HTML element
     (see the "must render a single HTML element" error otherwise), so the
     disabled/no-slots case is hidden via a CSS class instead of an #if
     wrapping the whole element away. --}}
<div class="elemental-charges-bar{{#unless elementalChargeSlots.length}} elemental-charges-bar-hidden{{/unless}}{{#unless elementalChargesEnabled}} elemental-charges-bar-hidden{{/unless}}">
  {{#each elementalChargeSlots as |slot|}}
  <div class="elemental-charge-slot {{slot.cssClass}}"
    {{#if slot.label}}data-tooltip="{{slot.label}}"{{/if}}>
    {{#if slot.school}}<span class="elemental-charge-abbr">{{slot.abbr}}</span>{{/if}}
  </div>
  {{/each}}
</div>
